{"timestamp": 1779366559.8061068, "event_type": "meeting_called", "tick": 26, "data": {"caller": "player_4", "reason": "Eve called an emergency meeting", "bodies": [{"room": "electrical", "victim_name": "Frank"}, {"room": "oxygen", "victim_name": "Alice"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779366559.806717, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 26, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779366591.0650518, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 26, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I called this because we\u2019ve got two dead: Frank is in electrical and Alice is in oxygen.\n\nMy route was upper engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 upper engine \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 security \u2192 weapons \u2192 cafeteria. Early on I saw Frank in oxygen around tick 5, then he left toward upper engine, and I saw him again in upper engine around tick 9. I saw Charlie enter medbay from electrical at tick 11 and leave toward upper engine at tick 12. Then Alice came into medbay from electrical around ticks 13-14. Later I saw Diana in security around ticks 22-23, then she went to weapons at tick 24.\n\nI didn\u2019t see Bob at all this round. I\u2019m not hard accusing yet, but the key info is Frank ended up dead in electrical, and Charlie/Alice were the people I saw around the medbay/electrical area earlier. Alice later died in oxygen."}}
{"timestamp": 1779366624.5482008, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 26, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My route was security \u2192 weapons \u2192 back through security \u2192 electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 upper engine \u2192 lower engine \u2192 storage. I saw Alice in weapons around tick 5, then later I saw Alice enter electrical from security at tick 10, and she was still alive with me in electrical at tick 11. I did not see Frank or any body in electrical while I was there.\n\nI left electrical to medbay, and I saw Eve in medbay around tick 12, which matches what she said about seeing me. After that I went upper engine, lower engine, then storage, and I didn\u2019t see anyone else.\n\nSo for Frank in electrical: he wasn\u2019t dead there when I passed through with Alice at tick 10-11, unless I somehow missed him, but I don\u2019t think so. That means Frank likely died in electrical after I left. Alice was alive in electrical then, but since Alice also ended up dead in oxygen, I don\u2019t know what to make of that. I didn\u2019t see Bob at all either, and I only have Eve as a partial witness for me leaving electrical into medbay."}}
{"timestamp": 1779366659.568199, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 26, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "My route was medbay \u2192 upper engine \u2192 lower engine \u2192 storage \u2192 navigation \u2192 security \u2192 weapons.\n\nImportant info: I saw Frank alive in lower engine at ticks 12, 13, and 14. I also saw him enter lower engine from upper engine at tick 12. So Charlie saying he left electrical around tick 11 lines up \u2014 Frank was definitely not dead in electrical yet at that point.\n\nLater I saw Eve in security around ticks 21-22, and I saw her leave security toward weapons at tick 23. That matches most of what she said about seeing me near security/weapons.\n\nI never saw Alice at all this round, and I never saw Bob either. Based on Frank being alive in lower engine at 14, Frank\u2019s electrical death had to be after that. Charlie looks less suspicious for Frank specifically. Bob being completely unseen by multiple people is concerning, but I want to hear Bob\u2019s route before deciding."}}
{"timestamp": 1779366673.395576, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 26, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Alright, I know I've been a ghost to everyone, so let me lay out my full route: electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 weapons \u2192 security \u2192 navigation \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 oxygen. It's a long loop because I was bouncing between task rooms.\n\nHere's what I can add that actually matters: I was in storage around tick 16-17 and I saw Frank come into storage from lower engine at tick 17, then leave storage toward medbay at 17. That lines up perfectly with Diana seeing him alive in lower engine at 12-14. Then at tick 19 I saw Frank go from medbay into electrical. I followed roughly that path \u2014 I was in electrical around tick 20 and Frank was alive there with me. After that I left to medbay, then cafeteria, then oxygen, where I just found Alice's body and Eve called the meeting.\n\nSo Frank was alive entering electrical at tick 19. Whoever was in electrical after tick 20 is the killer for Frank. I left electrical and went back through medbay/cafeteria.\n\nFor Alice \u2014 she died in oxygen, and I literally just walked into oxygen and found her. I didn't see anyone else there.\n\nHonestly, Diana's account of being in security/weapons late lines up with Eve seeing her. Charlie said he went upper engine \u2192 lower engine \u2192 storage late, but I was in storage and didn't see Charlie there. That's a small flag for me. I'm leaning Charlie, but I want to hear a response before I lock in."}}
{"timestamp": 1779366733.6054668, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 26, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Bob is the strongest sus for me now. He\u2019s the only one placing himself with Frank alive in electrical at tick 20, and Frank ends up dead there. Then Bob\u2019s route goes straight toward oxygen where Alice\u2019s body is, and he says he \u201cfound\u201d it but didn\u2019t report before my emergency went off.\n\nThe Charlie/storage thing isn\u2019t enough for me \u2014 if Charlie got to storage after tick 17, Bob could\u2019ve missed him. Diana is vouched late by me in security/weapons and doesn\u2019t fit Frank\u2019s electrical death as well.\n\nI\u2019m leaning Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779366755.558828, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 26, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "Bob\u2019s \u201cCharlie wasn\u2019t in storage\u201d point doesn\u2019t really hold \u2014 he says he was there around 16-17, and I got to storage at the very end of my route after medbay \u2192 upper \u2192 lower, so he easily could\u2019ve missed me.\n\nThe bigger issue is Bob\u2019s own story. He says Frank was alive with him in electrical around tick 20, then Bob leaves, and Frank ends up dead in electrical. That puts Bob as the last confirmed person with Frank at the crime scene.\n\nThen Bob\u2019s route goes medbay \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 oxygen, and Alice is dead in oxygen. So Bob is also the one who ends up at the second body location, and he didn\u2019t report it before Eve called.\n\nDiana and Eve match each other late near security/weapons, and I was seen leaving electrical before Frank was even in there. I think Bob has the best opportunity for both kills. I\u2019m voting Bob unless something huge changes."}}
